WEBVTT

01:36.250 --> 01:39.240
Okay, men! Everyone line up here!

01:41.720 --> 01:46.000
Soma Akira
Glasses Club President

01:43.050 --> 01:46.010
I called you here today
for one reason only.

01:46.680 --> 01:51.180
Kimata Hayato
Glasses Club Provisional Member
(Fake Glasses)

01:47.550 --> 01:49.360
Huh? You called us?

01:49.360 --> 01:52.130
I thought we came here for
our club meeting like always...

01:55.860 --> 01:59.170
Kamatani Mitsuki
Glasses Club Member

01:57.010 --> 01:59.170
He did that because you talked over him.

02:00.000 --> 02:03.160
I called you here today
for one reason only.

02:03.160 --> 02:05.620
To conduct an MR Snap Inspection!

02:07.120 --> 02:08.560
MR Snap Inspection

02:09.250 --> 02:13.440
Minabe Yukiya
Glasses Club Member

02:10.170 --> 02:13.450
An MR Snap Inspection?

02:14.050 --> 02:20.450
Hachimine Takuma
Glasses Club Member

02:14.790 --> 02:17.110
Wh-Wh-What will I do?

02:17.110 --> 02:20.450
There hasn't been one in so long,
I let my guard down!

02:20.930 --> 02:23.580
This will be my first time
experiencing it.

02:23.940 --> 02:26.450
Soma-senpai, my first time

02:26.450 --> 02:27.970
is in your hands!

02:28.290 --> 02:29.400
Leave it to me!

02:30.210 --> 02:31.330
Umm...

02:31.800 --> 02:32.970
Yes, Hayato?

02:32.970 --> 02:34.580
What is the

02:34.890 --> 02:38.090
MR Snap Inspection?

02:38.730 --> 02:42.770
People tend to be indifferent to things
that seem unnecessary to them.

02:42.770 --> 02:49.510
Yet unnecessary, seemingly meaningless
things bring richness into their lives.

02:49.510 --> 02:53.140
Soma-senpai's words really
permeate my heart.

02:53.140 --> 02:55.860
No! They permeate my glasses.

02:56.150 --> 02:58.660
Something unnecessary to me?

02:58.660 --> 03:00.240
You don't know?

03:01.470 --> 03:03.160
It's this.

03:05.140 --> 03:06.420
AAAARGH

03:06.600 --> 03:09.450
Ow! That hurts! That really hurts!

03:08.050 --> 03:10.410
That's right. MR refers to

03:10.740 --> 03:12.410
glasses lenses!

03:16.270 --> 03:20.890
I will use this snap inspection to check
your lenses for damage and dirt,

03:20.890 --> 03:24.970
to learn in detail how you
treat your MR on a daily basis!

03:26.700 --> 03:35.440
ROAR

03:28.200 --> 03:32.770
Soma-kun's MR are as amazing as ever.
They're not even slightly fogged.

03:32.770 --> 03:34.460
100 points! A perfect score!

03:35.440 --> 03:38.280
ROAR

03:36.230 --> 03:38.280
Th-They're beautiful!

03:38.480 --> 03:40.220
President, I...

03:40.220 --> 03:44.280
Even though I don't have lenses,
I want to take the snap inspection!

03:44.410 --> 03:47.450
I know it's totally impossible, and yet...

03:47.600 --> 03:51.210
I want to stand on the same stage as you!

03:51.640 --> 03:52.970
Then you may.

03:55.660 --> 03:58.200
MR Snap Inspection, commence!

03:58.570 --> 04:00.480
Yukiya: 78 points.

04:01.370 --> 04:03.140
Takuma: 60 points.

04:04.490 --> 04:06.420
Mitsuki: 95 points.

04:06.420 --> 04:07.850
Yeah!

04:09.610 --> 04:13.490
That is all! Today's MR Snap
Inspection is over!

04:13.610 --> 04:16.240
I knew he would ignore me!

04:18.630 --> 04:22.010
It's true that I don't have lenses, though.

04:22.010 --> 04:26.940
You can't inspect what's not there.
That goes without saying, right?

04:28.250 --> 04:29.250
Hayato:

04:29.750 --> 04:31.650
-11 points.

04:34.060 --> 04:37.390
President, you gave me a score too?

04:37.810 --> 04:41.880
In this moment, you have acquired
the lenses known as "regret."

04:42.760 --> 04:43.760
Sir...

04:44.390 --> 04:47.200
He really doesn't have them, though.

04:48.640 --> 04:53.720
My eyes! My eyes!

04:50.380 --> 04:53.720
78 points. Very strict.

04:54.320 --> 04:57.590
For any glasses wearer,
scratches are unavoidable.

04:57.590 --> 05:01.120
You want to wipe them, but if you do,
you'll damage them to some extent.

05:04.640 --> 05:07.810
If only there were a glasses wipe
that wouldn't scratch your lenses

05:07.810 --> 05:10.080
no matter how much you wipe them.

05:10.080 --> 05:11.480
True.

05:11.480 --> 05:14.330
But where would we find such
a miraculous glasses wipe?

05:18.960 --> 05:20.840
The miraculous glasses wipe that won't damage your lenses no matter how much you wipe them

05:18.970 --> 05:20.840
Glasses Celeb
New Product On Sale

05:18.970 --> 05:20.840
The Three Miracles
of Glasses Celeb
1. Thickness and Composition
2. Aroma
3. Humidity

05:18.970 --> 05:20.840
Bargain Sale

05:21.890 --> 05:24.300
Glasses!

05:25.400 --> 05:26.810
Glasses Celeb?

05:26.810 --> 05:29.330
They've developed something like that?

05:29.330 --> 05:31.890
The potential of glasses is truly terrifying.

05:32.050 --> 05:33.680
Hey, hey, hey, hey!

05:33.750 --> 05:34.600
Hayato!

05:34.600 --> 05:37.060
Let's go buy some Glasses Celeb!

05:38.180 --> 05:39.500
Of course we will!

05:39.850 --> 05:41.490
Kawaii Pharmacy

05:54.770 --> 05:56.250
Drugs

05:54.770 --> 05:56.250
Prescription Service

06:00.770 --> 06:02.250
Insurance Dispensing      Prescription Service      Glasses Pharmacy

06:05.200 --> 06:07.850
I can't believe all of the
stores were sold out!

06:08.080 --> 06:11.680
There are no other pharmacies
in our town, right?

06:11.680 --> 06:13.220
What will we do, Akira?

06:17.740 --> 06:19.780
We'll ride to the next town over!

06:29.460 --> 06:31.170
It's coming. The curve.

06:50.130 --> 06:52.010
Mitsuki loses!

06:54.190 --> 06:56.380
Let's have a rematch!

06:56.510 --> 06:58.150
That's the spirit!

07:10.910 --> 07:12.890
Total victory, eh?

07:12.890 --> 07:15.420
Kamatani's abdominal
muscles are too weak.

07:15.620 --> 07:17.930
Mit-chan's so weak.

07:18.380 --> 07:20.010
We'll try again on the way home!

07:20.950 --> 07:22.450
Hey!

07:23.050 --> 07:26.130
I brought five piping hot sarada-yaki!

07:27.610 --> 07:30.140
You can't glasses on an
empty stomach, after all!

07:30.500 --> 07:32.730
Let's eat!

07:32.730 --> 07:34.740
Saburoku Sarada-yaki

07:32.730 --> 07:36.700
The Flavor of Edo
Imagawa-yaki

07:32.730 --> 07:36.700
Azuki Bean Paste
Custard
Sarada-yaki

07:34.410 --> 07:37.410
I can't get enough of that heavy mayonnaise!

07:37.410 --> 07:40.200
It's certainly an immoral combination.

07:38.740 --> 07:40.480
Mayonnaise

07:38.740 --> 07:40.480
Radish
Sprouts

07:38.740 --> 07:40.480
Roast Ham

07:40.690 --> 07:42.280
By the way, President.

07:42.280 --> 07:44.850
What's so great about Glasses Celeb?

07:45.280 --> 07:46.380
Yukiya!

07:55.640 --> 08:01.310
Glasses Celeb

07:55.980 --> 07:58.220
For some time, rumors have
been passed in hushed tones

07:58.220 --> 08:01.050
among glasses wearers
about Glasses Celeb.

08:01.940 --> 08:03.920
It's a wondrous, no,

08:03.920 --> 08:05.630
a miraculous glasses wipe!

08:06.050 --> 08:07.400
A wondrous...

08:07.400 --> 08:08.350
No...

08:08.350 --> 08:10.630
...miraculous glasses wipe?

08:11.250 --> 08:16.080
So, what is it that makes Glasses Celeb
so wondrous and miraculous?

08:18.240 --> 08:28.210
The Three Miracles of Glasses Celeb: 1
Thickness and Material

08:18.240 --> 08:28.210
Previous Brands  Glasses Celeb

08:18.370 --> 08:22.640
The first miracle of Glasses Celeb:
thickness and material.

08:22.640 --> 08:26.410
It is somewhat thicker than
previous glasses wipes.

08:26.410 --> 08:29.870
Yet despite its thickness,
it is also the softest in history.

08:28.210 --> 08:29.870
The softest in history!

08:29.870 --> 08:33.790
Gentle
Sturdy

08:30.320 --> 08:33.770
I name this "the genturdy material"!

08:35.170 --> 08:37.600
A combination of gentle and sturdy?!

08:37.600 --> 08:39.000
Amazing!

08:40.810 --> 08:44.440
The Three Miracles of Glasses Celeb: 2

08:40.810 --> 08:44.440
Aroma

08:41.050 --> 08:44.480
The second miracle of
Glasses Celeb: aroma.

08:45.140 --> 08:47.280
Glasses Celeb integrates an herb

08:47.280 --> 08:49.010
used since ancient times
to relieve eyestrain:

08:49.700 --> 08:51.870
Eyebright Extract.

08:51.870 --> 08:54.350
Wear glasses cleaned with
Glasses Celeb and you'll think,

08:54.350 --> 08:57.720
"Oh, how strange! My eyestrain
is completely gone!"

08:58.300 --> 08:59.940
I name this herb

08:59.940 --> 09:02.480
"the bridge between eyes and glasses"!

09:03.980 --> 09:08.120
Bridging the gap that's separated
glasses and eyes for eternity!

09:08.120 --> 09:10.580
Just like Romeo and Juliet!

09:10.580 --> 09:12.920
The two of them together at last, at last!

09:12.920 --> 09:16.780
No one wants to hear love stories
from you, Fake Glasses!

09:18.510 --> 09:22.430
The Three Miracles of Glasses Celeb: 3

09:18.510 --> 09:22.430
Humidity

09:18.890 --> 09:22.170
The third miracle of
Glasses Celeb: humidity.

09:23.220 --> 09:28.290
Glasses Celeb is neither totally dry, nor totally wet.

09:23.460 --> 09:26.520
Glasses Celeb preserves
a perfect humidity,

09:26.520 --> 09:28.290
neither fully wet nor fully dry.

09:28.500 --> 09:30.100
I call this humidity

09:30.100 --> 09:32.590
"the hanpen of the glasses wipe world"!

09:34.120 --> 09:38.060
Wait, wait. Wait a minute.
What do you mean, hanpen?

09:38.370 --> 09:40.030
You don't know what hanpen is?

09:40.030 --> 09:44.760
It's not that! But is the humidity
of hanpen really that perfect?

09:45.860 --> 09:47.660
You're such a child, Hayato.

09:48.380 --> 09:52.270
You do not yet know even
half of the appeal of hanpen!

09:52.270 --> 09:54.850
What? Half? Really?!

09:54.850 --> 09:57.080
Really, really!

10:00.240 --> 10:01.240
Let's go!

10:01.240 --> 10:02.490
Okay!

10:01.240 --> 10:02.490
Drugs

10:03.020 --> 10:05.980
Wait for us, Glasses Celeb.

10:20.970 --> 10:23.910
Drugs

10:21.120 --> 10:22.490
I beg you!

10:22.490 --> 10:23.940
Welcome!

10:24.330 --> 10:27.230
Glasses
Club

10:24.330 --> 10:27.230
Kawaii Pharmacy

10:25.000 --> 10:27.240
Sell us some Glasses Celeb!

10:27.700 --> 10:31.740
Wait just a moment. I'll bring it right out.

10:32.850 --> 10:34.880
This is a big store!

10:34.880 --> 10:37.990
I see things here that they
don't sell in our town.

10:38.480 --> 10:41.770
Shall we take a look around while
we wait for the Glasses Celeb?

10:41.770 --> 10:43.370
Yay!

10:46.040 --> 10:47.040
Glasses!

10:48.930 --> 10:51.640
This is the shampoo I use!

10:52.580 --> 10:54.930
A shampoo made from all-natural ingredients?

10:54.930 --> 10:57.240
My big brother recommended it.

10:57.240 --> 11:00.470
It's good for getting dirt off your MR, too.

11:01.340 --> 11:04.690
Takuma, you haven't been washing
your MR in the bath, have you?!

11:04.930 --> 11:08.940
Yeah, sure. I wash my lenses
while I'm washing my hair.

11:13.670 --> 11:14.150
Divide

11:14.400 --> 11:14.900
Divide

11:15.150 --> 11:15.370
Divide

11:15.690 --> 11:16.760
This...

11:17.530 --> 11:20.870
This is why you're a 60-pointer!

11:21.140 --> 11:23.670
Oh, really?

11:24.260 --> 11:27.270
It is true that shampoo will remove oil.

11:27.280 --> 11:28.590
But at the same time—

11:31.380 --> 11:35.370
It strips lens coating and
frame paint as well.

11:35.850 --> 11:40.930
Celluloid frames like yours may also
warp from the heat and humidity.

11:40.930 --> 11:44.940
So that's why my glasses
become loose so quickly.

11:44.940 --> 11:48.370
You may want to get yourself
some bath glasses if you can.

11:49.400 --> 11:50.390
Glasses!

11:50.390 --> 11:51.910
Removes dirt on lenses!

11:50.390 --> 11:51.910
Glasses Cleaner

11:50.390 --> 11:51.910
Dry Type

11:50.390 --> 11:51.910
Leaves no
fibers behind!

11:51.900 --> 11:54.290
Yukiya-senpai, is that what you use?

11:54.290 --> 11:55.290
Yes.

11:55.290 --> 11:59.730
Dry-type disposable glasses wipes?
That's not what I expected.

11:59.970 --> 12:03.880
You seem like the type who hates
when his hands get dirty.

12:03.880 --> 12:05.980
I assumed you would use the wet type.

12:05.980 --> 12:07.900
Why the wet type?

12:07.900 --> 12:09.160
If you use wet ones,

12:09.160 --> 12:12.970
you'd be able to clean your hands
while you clean your MR.

12:13.460 --> 12:14.660
You have it backwards.

12:14.660 --> 12:18.330
The MR and yPad are equally delicate.

12:18.330 --> 12:21.960
To touch them with dirty fingers
is out of the question.

12:20.110 --> 12:21.960
Out of the question.

12:21.960 --> 12:22.970
Glasses.

12:24.980 --> 12:26.760
I think I'll buy this.

12:26.760 --> 12:28.920
What do you use that for?

12:28.920 --> 12:31.190
I put dish detergent in it.

12:33.320 --> 12:37.280
Actually, it's so that I'm prepared if Soma-senpai
ever says he wants to clean his glasses.

12:33.490 --> 12:37.280
It's so that I'm prepared to clean
glasses anywhere, at any time.

12:37.750 --> 12:41.530
Two bottles of glasses cleaner spray,
ten sheets of glasses wipes,

12:41.530 --> 12:43.940
dish detergent, pocket tissues,

12:43.940 --> 12:46.200
and paper towels.
I keep some on me at all times.

12:46.200 --> 12:48.190
ROAR

12:48.410 --> 12:51.220
As I would expect from a 95-pointer.
You're prepared for all occasions.

12:51.220 --> 12:53.290
I'm honored by the flattery.

12:53.290 --> 12:54.290
Glasses!

12:54.440 --> 12:57.730
By the way, Soma-senpai,
how do you take care of yours?

12:57.730 --> 13:00.460
Please tell me for future reference!

13:00.780 --> 13:01.760
Me?

13:02.500 --> 13:03.720
I...

13:03.720 --> 13:06.820
...get home and immediately rinse off
the dust with running water,

13:06.820 --> 13:09.100
then wash them lightly in lukewarm
water mixed with detergent.

13:09.100 --> 13:11.760
After I wash them, I rinse them
thoroughly with running water again,

13:11.760 --> 13:14.490
air dry, then polish the lenses
gently with five tissues.

13:14.490 --> 13:16.770
From there I wipe the water from
the temples and nose pads,

13:16.770 --> 13:18.740
then polish them all off using
a cloth glasses wipe.

13:19.370 --> 13:20.220
That.

13:20.610 --> 13:23.520
And... then... hmm...

13:24.280 --> 13:28.500
But how do MR get so dirty to begin with?

13:29.760 --> 13:32.410
There are many things that
can soil glasses lenses.

13:33.090 --> 13:36.330
One cause is contact with
eyelashes that contain oil.

13:36.330 --> 13:39.840
Another cause is tears that fly
onto the lenses when you blink,

13:39.840 --> 13:42.720
either when yawning or expelling
particulates from your eyes.

13:42.950 --> 13:45.070
Soma-senpai, you're amazing!

13:45.070 --> 13:47.870
There are as many ways of cleaning them
as there are of getting them dirty.

13:47.870 --> 13:50.090
Until now, the glasses
status quo has been that

13:50.090 --> 13:52.130
there is no one true solution, but...

13:52.130 --> 13:53.900
Look! Look! Look!

13:53.900 --> 13:55.570
Look at this!

13:55.570 --> 13:59.780
Ahahahahaha

13:55.840 --> 13:58.010
This is the new Hyper Demon Hard Spray!

13:58.010 --> 14:01.770
It's amazing! Look, it's all crunchy hard!

14:01.780 --> 14:02.940
Bang!

14:06.220 --> 14:07.870
My lachrymal gland is smashed!

14:08.470 --> 14:09.870
Minus 50 points!

14:09.870 --> 14:12.050
What are you doing, president?!

14:12.050 --> 14:15.880
I only gave you the same pain
that you gave to your temples.

14:15.880 --> 14:21.040
You used that "Hyper Demon Hard Spray"
stuff over your glasses, didn't you?

14:21.200 --> 14:23.080
Huh? Is that bad?

14:23.080 --> 14:24.380
Of course it is!

14:24.380 --> 14:27.310
Do you know what a strain
hair spray puts on temples?!

14:27.310 --> 14:30.340
Wipe them off now! Then
apologize to the temples!

14:33.160 --> 14:38.770
Sorry! Sorry! Sorry! Sorry!

14:33.910 --> 14:35.680
A far cry from a glasses wearer.

14:35.680 --> 14:38.050
He's even a failure as
a fake glasses wearer.

14:45.380 --> 14:47.310
Wait, Hayato!

14:47.810 --> 14:48.860
Yeah?

14:49.610 --> 14:50.910
Trust.

14:52.850 --> 14:55.760
What is it that we are waiting for?

14:56.260 --> 14:58.910
Glasses Celeb...

14:59.060 --> 15:00.080
The wondrous...

15:00.080 --> 15:00.940
No...

15:00.940 --> 15:02.760
The miraculous glasses wipe.

15:03.720 --> 15:07.700
I am sure they can clean not
only MR, but temples as well.

15:10.140 --> 15:12.140
The power of Glasses Celeb...

15:12.950 --> 15:15.680
Love

15:12.950 --> 15:15.680
Glasses

15:13.300 --> 15:15.680
Put your trust in it!

15:18.180 --> 15:21.260
Glasses Celeb

15:18.180 --> 15:21.270
Sorry for the wait!
Here is the Glasses Celeb.

15:21.820 --> 15:25.920
I'm so sorry. This appears to
be the last one we have.

15:25.920 --> 15:26.700
What?!

15:26.860 --> 15:29.710
They're a big seller in this store too, huh?

15:29.710 --> 15:31.040
That's right.

15:31.040 --> 15:33.760
There was a fellow in here who
bought several just a bit ago.

15:33.760 --> 15:36.520
But a single package will
be more than enough.

15:36.520 --> 15:39.380
One package should contain thirty sheets.

15:39.380 --> 15:41.630
We can get a lot of glasses
cleaning out of it.

15:42.340 --> 15:44.000
Takuma. The bill!

15:45.080 --> 15:49.300
Glasses Celeb
Cost per
Total cost

15:45.100 --> 15:49.300
Glasses Celeb is 2800 yen for one package.

15:49.300 --> 15:50.190
That's high!

15:50.190 --> 15:53.330
C-Can we afford that with
our paltry club funds?!

15:54.360 --> 15:56.360
And, in addition...

15:58.160 --> 16:03.320
From the 2800 yen, we get 80%
off for the bargain sale.

16:03.320 --> 16:06.960
Of course! Glasses Celeb is a
new product on bargain sale!

16:06.960 --> 16:10.150
80% off 2800 yen is...

16:18.020 --> 16:20.110
About 500 yen.

16:20.450 --> 16:21.670
I think.

16:22.390 --> 16:24.620
*He's actually 60 yen short.

16:22.600 --> 16:24.210
So we can afford it!

16:24.770 --> 16:26.510
That advertisement...

16:26.510 --> 16:28.140
is actually from yesterday.

16:46.900 --> 16:47.950
Why?

16:48.790 --> 16:52.330
Why did we end up with
yesterday's advertisement?

16:54.940 --> 16:56.040
Why?

16:56.450 --> 16:58.950
Why are our club funds so low?

17:05.730 --> 17:07.050
Why?!

17:14.540 --> 17:16.690
Long ago, people said...

17:17.240 --> 17:19.810
Fog on a lens reflects
the fog on your heart.

17:20.240 --> 17:23.300
In a fog-shrouded world,
there can be only despair.

17:27.640 --> 17:28.570
Is that...

17:28.770 --> 17:32.240
I see you're deep in despair. Perfect.

17:32.240 --> 17:33.460
Gentlemen of the Glasses Club.

17:33.980 --> 17:35.120
You!

17:41.000 --> 17:43.500
Let me inform you of
something, Glasses Club!

17:44.360 --> 17:47.300
Everything you have done today...

17:47.300 --> 17:50.240
We, the Himaraya 3rd Technical
School Student Council,

17:50.240 --> 17:53.080
in short, the Hima Council,

17:53.080 --> 17:55.060
orchestrated personally!

17:59.240 --> 18:01.350
Suzuki Toru
Student Council Member

18:02.990 --> 18:05.110
Tanaka Antonio
Student Council Member

18:05.540 --> 18:07.650
Takahashi Maximilian
Student Council Member

18:08.080 --> 18:10.440
Watanabe Lorenzo
Student Council Vice President

18:10.880 --> 18:13.770
The stress of going everywhere yet
being unable to buy Glasses Celeb...

18:13.770 --> 18:17.770
And when you finally
thought you'd found it...

18:17.770 --> 18:20.120
The unexpected twist!

18:23.040 --> 18:28.170
That moment broke your glasses-loving
hearts to pieces, I expect.

18:28.170 --> 18:29.560
After something like that,

18:29.560 --> 18:33.080
you'll be wanting to put an end to
your nonsensical Glasses Club activi—

18:33.820 --> 18:35.040
Excuse me.

18:40.180 --> 18:43.600
Huh?! W-Wait a minute! Dammit!

18:43.970 --> 18:45.600
Don't ignore me, dammit!

18:46.340 --> 18:48.090
Wh-Why?!

18:48.090 --> 18:52.060
I get it! Their lenses are all dirty
and they can't see very well!

18:54.440 --> 18:56.020
Poor guys.

18:56.480 --> 18:59.610
At a time like this, if only
they had some Glasses Celeb...

19:02.130 --> 19:04.120
This is all according to plan.

19:04.630 --> 19:08.810
At their level of depression,
even if we don't rub it in,

19:08.810 --> 19:12.300
they won't have the heart to continue
the Glasses Club, I expect.

19:34.650 --> 19:39.060
Glasses!

19:41.330 --> 19:43.220
Thank you, glasses.

19:46.470 --> 19:50.400
This is a trial that glasses have
bestowed upon our Glasses Club.

19:51.000 --> 19:53.090
No experience is truly meaningless.

19:53.090 --> 19:55.600
The events of today will
fuel us tomorrow.

20:01.240 --> 20:04.230
We don't need glasses wipes
that someone else made.

20:04.230 --> 20:06.100
We're going to develop our own,

20:06.100 --> 20:08.090
our very own glasses wipes!

20:08.090 --> 20:09.770
President! I'm in!

20:10.090 --> 20:12.570
I feel totally cheered up all of a sudden!

20:12.570 --> 20:15.570
Gratitude for the flexibility
of glasses, I imagine.

20:15.570 --> 20:18.900
Making our own would
be more economical.

20:18.900 --> 20:21.800
Two birds, no, four birds with one stone!

20:22.290 --> 20:24.450
I knew he would ignore me again!

20:24.370 --> 20:25.620
Ha ha ha ha ha

20:28.080 --> 20:30.880
By the way, president,
I've been wanting to ask this,

20:30.880 --> 20:33.200
but what's up with the back scratcher?

20:34.120 --> 20:36.130
Ignored that too, huh?

20:36.290 --> 20:39.360
What happened to that sense of despair?

20:39.360 --> 20:43.500
They went for a happy ending all by
themselves. What do we do?

20:44.080 --> 20:45.650
All for nothing.

20:48.680 --> 20:52.330
Everything we do is like
a water bubble, eh?

20:54.050 --> 20:58.020
A sorrowful epilogue!
The curtain has fallen.

20:58.880 --> 21:02.170
The endless applause was but an illusion.

21:02.820 --> 21:05.190
The next performance draws near.

21:05.190 --> 21:08.820
Well, Suzuki? How will you
conduct yourself?

21:08.820 --> 21:12.410
Dammit! Dammit!
This isn't over, Glasses Club!

21:12.660 --> 21:17.560
Humans are forgetful creatures.
They are no exception.

21:17.560 --> 21:19.400
Like flipping a light switch!

21:22.450 --> 21:23.960
The Hima Council motto!

21:26.480 --> 21:29.720
One for all! All for one!

21:29.960 --> 21:32.850
Everything we do is for the
Student Council President!

23:11.820 --> 23:13.680
My glasses are half under-rim.

23:12.090 --> 23:12.680
My glasses

23:13.180 --> 23:18.140
Half under-rim

23:13.680 --> 23:15.740
Yukiya-senpai's are metal semi-rimless.

23:15.010 --> 23:18.140
Metal semi-rimless

23:15.740 --> 23:17.130
They're both half frames.

23:17.130 --> 23:19.480
It looks like you could fit them
together like a puzzle, right?

23:18.890 --> 23:21.820
You could fit them together, right?

23:19.480 --> 23:21.500
Is that really what you think?

23:21.500 --> 23:24.140
I'm sorry! I don't really think that!

23:24.130 --> 23:25.960
No glasses, no life!

23:30.680 --> 23:32.750
Cat-eyes. Tomorrow's horoscope:

23:33.250 --> 23:35.940
You will overtake your rival!

23:37.600 --> 23:38.710
...I expect.
